<title>UK: Wuerttemberger Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttemberger Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.90	MATURITY   *07.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	STRAIGHT   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    06.SEP.96</p>
<p> FEES   UNDISCLOSED   DENOMS (K) 1	   LISTING     STUTTGART</p>
<p>NOTES *3.90 PERCENT UNTIL 07.JAN.97 WHEN THERE IS A ONCE ONLY</p>
<p>	  CALL AT PAR AFTER WHICH THE COUPON IS 5.00 PERCENT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
